nverified":true},{"surface":"மாப்பட்","parts":[{"text":"மாப்பட்","lemma":"மாப்பட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டாஅங்","parts":[{"text":"டாஅங்","lemma":"டாஅங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கிதுமற்","parts":[{"text":"கிதுமற்","lemma":"கிதுமற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றெவனோ","parts":[{"text":"றெவனோ","lemma":"றெவனோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நொதுமலர்","parts":[{"text":"நொதுமலர்","lemma":"நொதுமலர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தலையே","parts":[{"text":"தலையே","lemma":"தலையே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"See now, may you live, friend! The fertile / swift flood's nearby bank's deep pool cast / fishing net, a beast having been caught, like / this, then, what is it, in the place of strangers?","translation":"Look, my friend, may you live long! Like a wild beast trapped in a fishing net cast in the deep pool near the bank of the swift, fertile flood, what is this commotion now in the neighborhood of strangers?","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! புதுவருவாய் தரும் வேகமான வெள்ளம் வந்து சேரும் கரையை உடைய நெடிய குளத்தில் வீசப்பட்ட மீன் வலையிலே ஒரு விலங்கு அகப்பட்டுக் கொண்டது போல, அயலார் வாழும் இப்பகுதியில் எழுந்துள்ள இந்த அலர் என்ன காரணத்தாலோ?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend about the rumors spreading in their neighborhood. The hero has been secretly visiting her, and the neighbors (strangers) have begun to gossip. She compares their secret love affair to a large, powerful beast that has accidentally become trapped in a fishing net cast in a deep pool of a swift river. Just as a trapped beast thrashes and causes a massive stir in the water, their secret love has caused a loud commotion among the villagers. This imagery belongs to the Marutam (riverine) landscape, where the swift flood represents uncontrollable passion and the fishing net represents social constraints.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.43],[1.6,2.16],[2.16,2.8],[2.8,3.33],[3.33,3.6],[3.6,4.7],[4.7,5.22],[5.22,5.58],[5.58,6.1],[6.1,6.47],[6.47,6.93],[6.93,7.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,2.08],[2.08,2.64],[2.64,3.4],[3.4,4.0],[4.0,4.2],[4.2,5.5],[5.5,6.06],[6.06,6.44],[6.44,7.0],[7.0,7.41],[7.41,7.9],[7.9,8.2]]},"sync":[[["காண்","see"],["இனி","now"]],[["வாழி","may you live"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["யாணர்","fresh fertility"]],[["கடும்புனல்","swift flood"]],[["கடும்புனல்","swift flood"],["அடைகரை","nearby bank"]],[["நெடுங்கயத்து","deep pool"]],[["நெடுங்கயத்து","deep pool"],["இட்ட","cast"]],[["மீன்வலை",""]],[["மாப்பட்",""]],[["டாஅங்",""]],[["கிதுமற்",""]],[["றெவனோ",""]],[["நொதுமலர்",""]],[["தலையே",""]]]}